<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 42 µm on Gasterosteus doryssus_mid (Truckee Fm, 10.01 Ma) — Code-to-model traceability: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "The module docstring states the PDE, the steady state, k_c, the mid-stage numbers, the chronoseries, and the claim boundary. jacobian, sigma_curve, stage_table, ratio_sweep, numerical_dispersion and integrate_schnakenberg each match one of those lines. The Lean module names the same nanometre wavelengths the script prints (32139, 41940, 56898). There is no line-by-line map onto numbered equations in Turing 1952, because the kinetics are the Schnakenberg reduction of that dispersion." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-code-traceability-2> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 42 µm on Gasterosteus doryssus_mid (Truckee Fm, 10.01 Ma) — Model fidelity to source: 86/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "jacobian, sigma_curve and fastest_mode implement the Schnakenberg linearisation and k_c = argmax σ(k). solve_du bisects Du so the mid mode is 41.94 µm. integrate_schnakenberg is an exponential spectral diffusion step plus two reaction substeps, with a hard clip at 8 that is a numerical stabiliser, not part of Schnakenberg. The GIF then composites the field onto the fossil, which is a render step, not the PDE. Four Lean theorems check wavelength order, diffusivity-ratio order, negative reaction trace, and a positive mid-stage Turing margin, with zero sorry." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.6e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Schnakenberg Turing wavelength at 42 µm on Gasterosteus doryssus_mid (Truckee Fm, 10.01 Ma) — Morphometric validation: 82/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Sixteen-wavenumber analytic versus RK2 growth rates: Pearson r = 0.9897, RMSE = 0.070. Equal-diffusion σ_max = -0.324 against a null of 0. Specimen coherency 0.596 versus registered-frame coherency 0.603; foreground fraction 0.589 versus 0.821. Radial-spectrum KS D = 0.333. Orientation-histogram Pearson r = 0.669. These are not self-copies. Missing this pass: a Du uncertainty band, an explicit stored pure-field CV, and a bone-versus-sediment split of the plate." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-pearson-r-analytic-vs-rk2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-gasterosteus-doryssus-mid-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-dispersion-rmse>,
