        "reconstructed_in_script: Spectral diffusion plus reaction substeps, ratio sweep, equal-diffusion control, RK2 dispersion check.",
        "reported_in_source: Bell & Haglund 1982 and Hunt, Bell & Travis 2008: directional pelvic reduction in Truckee Fm G. doryssus.",
        "reported_in_source: Kondo & Asai 1995: reaction-diffusion waves set pigment spacing on fish skin.",
