        "reported_in_source: Turing 1952 dispersion: a critical wavenumber selected by diffusion and reaction rates.",
        "reported_in_source: Voje, Bell & Stuart 2022: CC BY 4.0 plate of weakly and strongly armored G. doryssus morphs.",
        "transfer_boundary: 42 µm melanophore spacing is transferred from extant pigment-pattern RD onto a fossil that preserves bone, not chromatophores." ;
